      ],
      "source": "https://historicelpaso.com/historic_entry/segundo-barrio/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The neighborhood is known for its murals and cultural character, making it a living canvas of borderland heritage.",
