      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/El_Segundo_Barrio",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2021 El Segundo Barrio was added to the National Register of Historic Places, highlighting its adobe tenements and role in borderland history.",
